====================================================================
ALGORITHM BLUEPRINT: Connectivity (Star-Contraction) v2
Harness Archetype: Recursive HardCilk with 3-Stage Dataflow Pipeline
====================================================================

[MEMORY STATE ARRAYS]
- Parents Array: uint32_t (Standard AXI Memory)
- Graph Contexts: Memory pool for G_0, G_1, etc.

[INTERNAL HARDWARE FIFOS]
- `raw_edge_stream`: struct { u, v } (Depth 64)
- `surviving_edge_stream`: struct { parent_u, parent_v } (Depth 64)

--------------------------------------------------------------------
PE 1: THE RECURSIVE CONTRACTION ENGINE -> [USES #pragma HLS DATAFLOW]
--------------------------------------------------------------------
ROLE: Fetch edges, hook stars, and pack the contracted graph in a continuous stream.

    === SUB-PE A: The Edge Fetcher ===
    STEP A1: Read task payload (Pointer to G).
    STEP A2: The Burst Loop (II=1, runs over G.num_edges):
        - Read 1: AXI Burst Read -> Fetch edge `e = (u, v)`.
        - Push -> `e` into `raw_edge_stream` FIFO.

    === SUB-PE B: The Hook Engine ===
    STEP B1: The Compute Loop (II=1, drains `raw_edge_stream`):
        - POP `e = (u, v)` from `raw_edge_stream`.
        - Read 2: AXI Read -> `parent_u = Parents[u]`.
        - Read 3: AXI Read -> `parent_v = Parents[v]`.
        - Evaluate coin-flip / priority hooking logic.
        - IF (hook succeeds, e.g., `u` hooks to `v`):
            - Write 1: AXI Write -> Parents[u] = v.
        - IF (`parent_u != parent_v` AND hook failed):
            - Edge survives contraction! 
            - Push -> { `parent_u`, `parent_v` } into `surviving_edge_stream` FIFO.

    === SUB-PE C: The Graph Packer ===
    STEP C1: The Pack Loop (II=1, drains `surviving_edge_stream`):
        - POP surviving edge from `surviving_edge_stream`.
        - Write 2: AXI Burst Write -> Save edge to the new `G_prime` memory struct.
    STEP C2: When all sub-PEs finish:
        - Spawn `Connectivity_Cleanup` to the HardCilk Continuation Queue.
        - Spawn `Connectivity_Top` (Child task with `G_prime`) to `taskOutGlobal`.

--------------------------------------------------------------------
PE 2: THE CONTINUATION WORKER (Cleanup) -> [USES #pragma HLS DATAFLOW]
--------------------------------------------------------------------
ROLE: Wakes up when the child returns. Flattens the component hierarchy.

    === SUB-PE A: Vertex Fetcher ===
    STEP A1: Read continuation payload (Pointers to G and G_prime).
    STEP A2: The Burst Loop (II=1, runs over G.num_vertices):
        - Read 1: AXI Burst Read -> Fetch `u`.
        - Push -> `u` into `vertex_stream` FIFO.

    === SUB-PE B: Map & Update ===
    STEP B1: The Update Loop (II=1, drains `vertex_stream`):
        - POP `u` from `vertex_stream`.
        - Read 2: AXI Read -> `parent_u = Parents[u]`.
        - Read 3: AXI Read -> `final_comp = Parents_G_prime[parent_u]`.
        - Write 1: AXI Write -> Parents[u] = final_comp.
    STEP B2: Push completion token -> `argOut`.
====================================================================